error[type-mismatch] 10:17-10:25
    (sort-by (fn [[cust _]] cust)
                  ^^^^^^^^
  This parameter takes a tuple apart, but sort-by passes it a record.
  Expected: Record {customer: String, total: Int}
  Found: a tuple pattern [cust _]
  Fix: (fn [r] (get r :customer))
  Help: sx help sort-by
